            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>On p. 7, right column, the sentence &quot;The mean average reductions in pain and disability were maintained from the end of the double-blind to the end of the open-label period up to 3 years later&quot; is not correct. It should read &quot;2 years&quot; instead of &quot;3 years&quot;.</AbstractText>
